3618:       // process, not the context the destination path expects, so httpd/nginx
3619:       // silently gets permission-denied on perfectly-readable files. `restorecon`
3620:       // fixes every copied tree at once. A no-op on Debian/Ubuntu (AppArmor
3621:       // profiles are path-based and need nothing here, since we copy to the SAME
3622:       // absolute paths the source used).
