5142:     // The structured flag the UI keys off. worker/migrate.ts writes
5143:     // Migration.status = "DONE" unconditionally and persists ONLY
5144:     // summary.results into Migration.items.results — so the outcome is put at
5145:     // the TOP of results as a first-class line with a `failed` status, which is
