2503: /**
2504:  * Disable + mask every host web server we did NOT choose. Masking (not merely
2505:  * disabling) because a package upgrade or a leftover dependency can re-enable a
2506:  * disabled unit, and the whole point is that this cannot come back on its own at
2507:  * the next reboot. Fully reversible, and the command to reverse it is logged.
